 "comments": [
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "value": "May be involved in regulation of cell migration (PubMed:22846708, PubMed:25448675). May regulate cell-matrix interactions via its interaction with ITGB5 and modifying ITGB5 cytoplasmic tail interactions such as with FERMT2 and TLN1. May regulate ROCK1 kinase activity possibly involved in regulation of actin stress fiber formation (PubMed:25448675)"
    }
   ],
